<section class="nit nit-offer nit-section" aria-labelledby="nit-offer-heading">
      <div class="nit-container nit-offer__inner">
        <div class="nit-offer__head"><p class="nit-label nit-reveal">The offer</p><h2 class="nit-h1 nit-offer__heading nit-reveal" id="nit-offer-heading">
            One, two or three
          </h2><div class="nit-body nit-muted nit-measure nit-offer__intro nit-reveal">
              <p>Most people who buy a second one buy it for a partner's car. The multipacks exist because that keeps happening, and paying twice for the same thing is a poor reason to wait.</p>
            </div></div><form method="post" action="/cart/add" accept-charset="UTF-8" id="nit-offer-nit-offer" class="nit-offer__form" novalidate="novalidate"><input type="hidden" name="form_type" value="product"><input type="hidden" name="utf8" value="&#10003;"><fieldset class="nit-offer__fieldset">
            <legend class="nit-visually-hidden">Choose how many</legend>
            <div class="nit-offer__packs" data-nit-stagger>
              <label
          class="nit-offer__pack nit-reveal"
          
        >
          <input
            class="nit-offer__radio nit-offer__radio--1"
            type="radio"
            name="id"
            value="40000000000001"
            
            
          >

          <span class="nit-offer__pack-body">
            <span class="nit-offer__pack-name nit-h3">Single</span>

            <span class="nit-offer__total nit-nums">&#163;79.00</span>

            <span class="nit-offer__each nit-small nit-muted nit-nums">One vacuum</span><span class="nit-offer__stock nit-small">In stock</span>
          </span>
        </label><label
          class="nit-offer__pack nit-reveal is-elevated"
          
        >
          <input
            class="nit-offer__radio nit-offer__radio--2"
            type="radio"
            name="id"
            value="40000000000002"
            checked
            
          >

          <span class="nit-offer__pack-body">
            <span class="nit-offer__pack-name nit-h3">Double</span>

            <span class="nit-offer__total nit-nums">&#163;142.00</span>

            <span class="nit-offer__each nit-small nit-muted nit-nums">&#163;71.00 each</span><span class="nit-offer__saving nit-small nit-nums">
                2 &#215; &#163;79.00 is &#163;158.00, you save &#163;16.00
              </span><span class="nit-offer__note nit-small nit-muted">One for each car</span><span class="nit-offer__stock nit-small is-low">6 left</span>
          </span>
        </label><label
          class="nit-offer__pack nit-reveal"
          
        >
          <input
            class="nit-offer__radio nit-offer__radio--3"
            type="radio"
            name="id"
            value="40000000000003"
            
            
          >

          <span class="nit-offer__pack-body">
            <span class="nit-offer__pack-name nit-h3">Triple</span>

            <span class="nit-offer__total nit-nums">&#163;199.00</span>

            <span class="nit-offer__each nit-small nit-muted nit-nums">&#163;66.33 each</span><span class="nit-offer__saving nit-small nit-nums">
                3 &#215; &#163;79.00 is &#163;237.00, you save &#163;38.00
              </span><span class="nit-offer__note nit-small nit-muted">Enough for the household</span><span class="nit-offer__stock nit-small">In stock</span>
          </span>
        </label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="nit-offer__foot nit-reveal">
            <button
              class="nit-btn nit-btn--primary nit-offer__submit"
              type="submit"
              name="add"
              
            ><span class="nit-offer__cta-label">Add to basket</span>
                <span class="nit-offer__cta-price nit-offer__cta-price--1 nit-nums">&#163;79.00</span><span class="nit-offer__cta-price nit-offer__cta-price--2 nit-nums">&#163;142.00</span><span class="nit-offer__cta-price nit-offer__cta-price--3 nit-nums">&#163;199.00</span></button><p class="nit-small nit-muted nit-offer__reassurance">
                Free UK delivery. 30 days to change your mind.
              </p></div></form></div>
    </section>

